{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或馬頭明王"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從東北隅右旋塗拭，蓮子華、蜀葵葉、茅香、墨土相和，如法淨揩磨令光淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "再灑淨香水"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作此觀先觀外緣後引入己身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本不生義即是菩提心，今欲顯見以何方便而得見之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即是五輪字成佛身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即金輪別名，作金剛杵形，即方座，但觀四角壇中有本尊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即表金剛座"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此即是毘盧遮那，亦內火法身，義下皆準"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如塗灰等降伏火"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵本闕名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "意密"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即菩提心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或方"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "高一指"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘香準"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或不動"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前枳哩真言，四輪背相叉旋轉慧加定"}
