{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金剛拳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或十指、或四指，麁如頭指"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三遍、或廿一遍、或一百八遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或一百八遍、或廿一遍，又以小杓廿一遍沃火"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "扇底、增益布瑟置"}
