{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或部主加持"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "各以本真言請一一供養，或堂部并眷屬"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以滅惡趣真言三五七遍，出《金剛頂經》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一一供諸天等並如別文，復取飯食置小盆中施於四方鬼神等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "及宿曜等皆三遍祀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "令求增榮及富饒，令求愛敬願皆成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "量準前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "白檀為燒香油、麻油燈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前印"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "想眾鉤入彼心召來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "射於五處：額、兩乳、心、下分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "白色高一指"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以寶物供養"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "飯食以石榴汁染"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為燈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "請召準前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "血"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或用頭酢"}
